  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The proposed development has failed to adequately and appropriately address noise and odour impacts as a result of the extract flue and use of the premise as a restaurant via relevant reports. In absence of relevant reports insufficient information is provided to ensure the development would not have a harmful impact to amenities of neighbouring residential units within the immediate locale. As such, the development is contrary\r\nto the National Planning Policy Framework (2023),&amp;nbsp; Policies D3 of The London Plan (2021) and\r\nPolicy DM1 and DM38 of the Harrow Development Management Policies (2013).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
